  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[react-nouislider](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-nouislider) just published its new version 1.14.2.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      react-nouislider\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      1.14.2\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      dependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs react-nouislider is a direct dependency of this project **this is very likely breaking your project right now**. If other packages depend on you it’s very likely also breaking them.\nI recommend you give this issue a very high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 3 commits .\n\n- [`615758e`](https://github.com/algolia/react-nouislider/commit/615758e37232f30fd38489f2845048de1a8f5f0d) <code>1.14.2</code>\n- [`e896990`](https://github.com/algolia/react-nouislider/commit/e896990b652fa2a08b21dd124c1a00bfb38546a2) <code>Merge pull request #32 from patrickdevivo/master</code>\n- [`f883f33`](https://github.com/algolia/react-nouislider/commit/f883f33649f5d94724fca0aeaae4c6abda2ce24e) <code>update connect PropTypes</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/algolia/react-nouislider/compare/b8ca7a61037b161dc497619741b9f03b11613193...615758e37232f30fd38489f2845048de1a8f5f0d).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
